{"seq":3,"slug":"fuel-cell-supercap","title":"燃料电池与超级电容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/batteries/fuel-cell-supercap","wordCount":1610,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"燃料电池与超级电容\">燃料电池与超级电容</h1><p>电池把活性物质封装在内部，能量一放完就得换或充。但有两类器件跳出了这个框架：燃料电池把「燃料罐」和「发电机」分开，只要持续供应氢气和氧气，就能像内燃机一样源源不断地发电；超级电容则干脆不依赖化学反应，靠纯物理的电荷分离储能，能在几秒内充满、瞬间放出巨大功率。它们与电池构成储能技术的「铁三角」，各占能量-功率坐标系的一角。本篇讲清燃料电池的连续发电原理、超级电容的双电层储能、以及三者如何按场景分工。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>燃料电池是一种连续工作的原电池：燃料（通常是氢气）在阳极被氧化、氧气在阴极被还原，只要燃料不断供应就持续输出电流，理论上不存在「用完」。它不受卡诺循环限制，能量转换效率可超过传统热机。超级电容（也叫电化学电容器）则把能量存在 <a href=\"../kinetics/double-layer\">双电层与界面</a> 里——电荷在电极-电解液界面物理分离，无化学反应或仅有快速的表面反应，因此充放电极快、循环近乎无限。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[储能器件三角] --&gt; B[燃料电池&lt;br/&gt;连续发电]&#10;  A --&gt; C[超级电容&lt;br/&gt;双电层储能]&#10;  A --&gt; D[二次电池&lt;br/&gt;嵌入脱出储能]&#10;  B --&gt; E[高能量&lt;br/&gt;需燃料供应]&#10;  C --&gt; F[超高功率&lt;br/&gt;能量密度低]&#10;  D --&gt; G[高能量&lt;br/&gt;功率适中]&#10;  E --&gt; H[氢能交通/备电]&#10;  F --&gt; I[制动回收/瞬时功率]\">flowchart TD\n  A[储能器件三角] --&gt; B[燃料电池&lt;br/&gt;连续发电]\n  A --&gt; C[超级电容&lt;br/&gt;双电层储能]\n  A --&gt; D[二次电池&lt;br/&gt;嵌入脱出储能]\n  B --&gt; E[高能量&lt;br/&gt;需燃料供应]\n  C --&gt; F[超高功率&lt;br/&gt;能量密度低]\n  D --&gt; G[高能量&lt;br/&gt;功率适中]\n  E --&gt; H[氢能交通/备电]\n  F --&gt; I[制动回收/瞬时功率]</pre><p>下表把三类器件放在统一指标下对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>器件</th>\n<th>储能机理</th>\n<th>能量密度</th>\n<th>功率密度</th>\n<th>循环寿命</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>燃料电池</td>\n<td>燃料连续氧化还原</td>\n<td>极高（含燃料）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>取决于催化剂寿命</td>\n<td>氢能车、固定发电</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超级电容</td>\n<td>双电层电荷分离</td>\n<td>低（5~10 Wh/kg）</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>&gt;10⁵ 次</td>\n<td>瞬时功率、能量回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>锂离子电池</td>\n<td>离子嵌入脱出</td>\n<td>高（250~300 Wh/kg）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>10³~10⁴ 次</td>\n<td>通用储能</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"质子交换膜燃料电池\">质子交换膜燃料电池</h2><p>最具代表性的是质子交换膜燃料电池（PEMFC），以氢氧为例，两极反应是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>阳极</mtext><mo>:</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{阳极}: \\mathrm{H_2} \\rightarrow 2\\mathrm{H^+} + 2e^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">阳极</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9047em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>阴极</mtext><mo>:</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>e</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{阴极}: \\tfrac{1}{2}\\mathrm{O_2} + 2\\mathrm{H^+} + 2e^- \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H_2O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">阴极</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9047em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>总反应只是氢氧化合成水，副产物是清洁的水。质子穿过质子交换膜从阳极到阴极，电子走外电路供电。它的理论开路电压约 1.23 V，但实际工作电压明显更低——核心瓶颈在阴极的氧还原反应（ORR）动力学极慢、交换电流密度极低，需要很大的活化过电位，这正是 <a href=\"../kinetics/electrode-kinetics\">电极反应动力学</a> 里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决定性能的典型案例。为此必须用昂贵的铂基催化剂来压低过电位，铂的用量与成本是燃料电池规模化的主要障碍之一。降低铂载量、开发非贵金属 ORR 催化剂，是该领域长期的研究主线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超级电容-双电层与赝电容\">超级电容：双电层与赝电容</h2><p>超级电容的储能能力来自惊人的比表面积。它用多孔活性炭电极，比表面积可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2000</mn><mtext> </mtext><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000\\sim2000\\,\\mathrm{m^2/g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">/g</span></span></span></span></span></span>，把 <a href=\"../kinetics/double-layer\">双电层与界面</a> 里那 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>40</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>μ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\sim40\\,\\mu\\mathrm{F/cm^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">F/c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的界面电容乘以巨大面积，就得到法拉级的电容。其储能量遵循电容器公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\frac{1}{2}CV^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由于储能是纯物理的电荷分离、不涉及晶格结构变化，超级电容能在几秒内充满、循环上百万次不衰减，功率密度远超电池。代价是能量密度低——电压平方关系也意味着提高工作电压（靠有机电解液或离子液体）对提升能量格外有效。</p>\n<p>除了纯双电层电容，还有一类「赝电容」（pseudocapacitance），靠电极表面快速的可逆氧化还原反应储能（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{RuO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Ru</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{MnO_2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Mn</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），能量密度更高，介于双电层电容与电池之间。把电池型电极与电容型电极组合，就成了兼顾能量与功率的「混合电容器」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三者的分工-能量-功率坐标系\">三者的分工：能量-功率坐标系</h2><p>燃料电池、超级电容、电池在 Ragone 图（见 <a href=\"primary-secondary\">一次与二次电池</a>）上占据不同区域，决定了它们的应用分工。燃料电池能量密度极高（因为燃料外接、不计入器件本体），适合长续航、大功率的氢能重卡、船舶和固定式备用电源；超级电容功率密度极高但能量低，专攻瞬时大功率场景——电动车的再生制动能量回收、电梯/起重机的能量缓冲、风机变桨的应急电源；锂电则占据中庸而通用的能量-功率区间。</p>\n<p>实际系统常把它们组合互补。氢燃料电池车通常配一块电池或超级电容做「功率缓冲」：燃料电池稳态供能，超级电容应对急加速和回收制动能量，扬长避短。这种「能量源 + 功率源」的混合架构，是理解现代电动交通能量系统的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与电池的边界正在模糊\">与电池的边界正在模糊</h2><p>值得注意的是，这三类器件的技术边界在 2026 年正变得模糊。赝电容材料、预嵌锂的电容型负极、以及钠离子电容器，正把超级电容的能量密度往电池方向推；而高功率电池设计又在往电容的功率密度方向靠。它们共享同一套电化学语言——双电层、电极动力学、传质极化，区别只在储能机理的侧重。理解了 <a href=\"../kinetics/\">电极过程动力学</a> 这一章的三块基石，就能把任意新出现的储能器件归类、并预判它的性能取舍。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>燃料电池是连续工作的原电池，燃料持续供应即不断发电，不受卡诺限制；PEMFC 以氢氧合成水、副产物仅为水。</li>\n<li>PEMFC 的核心瓶颈是阴极氧还原动力学慢、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>j</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 低，需铂催化剂压低过电位，去铂化是研究主线。</li>\n<li>超级电容靠多孔碳的巨大比表面积放大双电层电容达法拉级，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E=\\frac{1}{2}CV^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，充放电极快、循环百万次；赝电容进一步提升能量。</li>\n<li>三类器件在能量-功率坐标系分工：燃料电池高能量、超级电容高功率、电池居中，常组合成「能量源+功率源」混合架构。</li>\n<li>2026 年器件边界趋于模糊，但都共享双电层、电极动力学、传质极化的统一语言，掌握 <a href=\"../kinetics/\">电极过程动力学</a> 即可归类预判。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"燃料电池与超级电容","id":"燃料电池与超级电容"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"质子交换膜燃料电池","id":"质子交换膜燃料电池"},{"level":2,"text":"超级电容：双电层与赝电容","id":"超级电容-双电层与赝电容"},{"level":2,"text":"三者的分工：能量-功率坐标系","id":"三者的分工-能量-功率坐标系"},{"level":2,"text":"与电池的边界正在模糊","id":"与电池的边界正在模糊"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"锂离子电池原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/batteries/lithium-ion"},"next":{"title":"电化学分析方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/electrochemistry/applications/electroanalytical"}}